      "name": "APT29 PHANTOM BEAR Mitigations",
      "description": "Recommended mitigations: (1) Block known C2 domains/IPs at perimeter. (2) Apply MS patch MS23-0397 for CVE-2023-23397. (3) Enable MFA for all remote access. (4) Deploy EDR with memory scanning. (5) Monitor for process hollowing targeting sqlwriter.exe. (6) Implement network segmentation. (7) Conduct spear-phishing awareness training. (8) Hunt for Registry persistence: HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run.",
      "created_by_ref": "identity--a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890"
    },
